{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOL","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约珥书","commonName":"约珥书","title":"约珥书","order":29,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"4fea8c005c758b8ea3fc142a25986d04841b2568dee52423510110df5b5a87e8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":73},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要审判万国"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“到那日，我要使犹大和耶路撒冷被掳的人返乡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时，我要聚集万国，带他们下到约沙法",{"noteId":2},"谷，在那里审判他们，因为他们把我的子民，就是我的产业以色列，分散到各国，并瓜分我的土地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们抽签分了我的子民，将男童换妓女，卖女童买酒喝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“泰尔、西顿和非利士境内所有的人啊，你们为什么这样对我？你们要报复我吗？如果你们是报复我，我必速速使你们遭报应。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你们夺去我的金银，抢走我的珍宝，拿去放在你们的庙中，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["并把犹大和耶路撒冷的居民卖给希腊人，使他们远离家乡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["然而，他们被卖到哪里，我要促使他们从哪里离开，并要使你们得到报应，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必把你们的儿女卖给犹大人，犹大人必把他们卖给远方的示巴人。这是耶和华说的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"你们去向列国宣告：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“要召集勇士，征调军队，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"前去打仗！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要将犁头打成刀剑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把镰刀铸成矛头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弱者要说自己是勇士！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四围的列国啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们快快聚集到那里吧！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你差遣大能的勇士降临。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“列国都要起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上到约沙法谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我要坐在那里审判周边列国。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"开镰吧，因为庄稼熟了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踩踏吧，因为榨酒池的葡萄满了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酒池满溢，因为他们恶贯满盈。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"千千万万的人聚集在审判谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的日子要临到那里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日月昏暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"星辰无光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华从锡安发出怒吼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从耶路撒冷发出雷声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地为之震动。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华却是祂子民的避难所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列人的堡垒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“这样，你们就知道我是你们的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我住在我的圣山锡安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必为圣城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人必不再侵犯它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“到那日，群山要滴下甜酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丘陵要流出乳汁。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大的溪涧碧水常流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有清泉从耶和华的殿中流出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"浇灌什亭谷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及必一片荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以东必成为荒凉的旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们曾残暴地对待犹大人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在犹大滥杀无辜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但犹大必常有人住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必存到万代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必追讨","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"尚未追讨的血债，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华住在锡安。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"“约沙法”意思是“耶和华审判”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"“追讨”希伯来文是“洗净”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}